@startuml Contest Round 2

skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #E8E8E8
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #888888
skinparam ActivityFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #E8E8E8
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #888888
skinparam PartitionBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam PartitionBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam NoteBorderColor #AAAAAA

title Contest Round 2

|Staff|
start
:Select contest for Round 2;
:Set Round 2 dates\n& table count (3-6);

|System|
:Find contest by ID;

if (ROUND_2 already exists?) then ([Yes])
  |Staff|
  :Error: Round 2 already exists;
  detach
else ([No])
  :Get qualified competitors\n(status: ORIGINAL_SUBMITTED);
  :Validate table count (3-6);

  if (Enough competitors?) then ([Yes])
    :Distribute competitors across\ntables using snake-draft algorithm;

    note right
      Snake-draft ensures balanced
      distribution across tables
    end note

    while (More tables?) is ([Yes])
      :Create Round entity\n(type: ROUND_2, table);
      while (More competitors\nin table?) is ([Yes])
        :Create Painting entity\n(status: ACCEPTED)\nfor each competitor;
      endwhile ([No])
    endwhile ([No])

    |Staff|
    :Round 2 created successfully;
  else ([No])
    |Staff|
    :Error: Not enough competitors;
    detach
  endif
endif

|Competitor|
:Arrive at competition venue;
:Receive assigned table\n& painting materials;

note right
  Each finalist draws
  live at their assigned table
end note

:Create artwork on-site;

|Staff|
:Photograph/scan each\nfinalist's artwork;
:Upload drawing to system;

|System|
:Upload image to\nFirebase Storage;
:Get signed URL;
:Update Painting entity\nwith image URL;

note right
  Repeat for each
  competitor's drawing
end note

|Examiner|
:View Round 2 paintings\nassigned for evaluation;

|System|
:Find Round 2 paintings\nassigned to this examiner;

|Examiner|
:Grade with detailed criteria;

note right
  Criteria:
  - Creativity
  - Composition
  - Color usage
  - Technical skill
  - Aesthetic quality
end note

|System|
:Validate all criteria scores;
:Calculate final score =\nweighted average of criteria;
:Save evaluation record;
:Update painting finalScore;

|Staff|
:View Round 2 results\n& final rankings;

stop

@enduml
